text Naranja_Route110_TrickHousePuzzle4_Text_0819D1DE {
    "It’s too much bother to think this out.\nI only wanted to battle!"
}

text Naranja_Route110_TrickHousePuzzle4_Text_0819D21F {
    "Even though I lost, I still like battling\nthe best!"
}

text Naranja_Route110_TrickHousePuzzle4_Text_0819D253 {
    "Wouldn’t you agree? You would go\nanywhere if TRAINERS were there."
}

text Naranja_Route110_TrickHousePuzzle4_Text_0819D295 {
    "Heh! Boulders like this, I can brush\naside with one finger!"
}

text Naranja_Route110_TrickHousePuzzle4_Text_0819D2D1 {
    "I can push boulders, but I can’t solve\nthe puzzle..."
}

text Naranja_Route110_TrickHousePuzzle4_Text_0819D306 {
    "It’s not good enough to be brawny...\nYou have to use your head. Be brainy!"
}

text Naranja_Route110_TrickHousePuzzle4_Text_0819D351 {
    "The TRICK HOUSE is getting trickier,\nisn’t it?"
}

text Naranja_Route110_TrickHousePuzzle4_Text_0819D380 {
    "Aaak!"
}

text Naranja_Route110_TrickHousePuzzle4_Text_0819D386 {
    "Has anyone made it to the end?"
}
